G c Z s b [init gpio 53 11 none]
G c Z s b [readbutton0 gpio 54 10 none]
G c Z s b [readbutton1 gpio 55 10 none]
G c Z s b [enciendergb gpio 56 11 none]
G c Z s s [ctrl_btnIP gpio 12 9 none]
G c Z s s [gpio_btnIP gpio 22 9 none]
G c Z s s [ctrl_rgbIP gpio 38 9 none]
G c Z s s [gpio_rgbIP gpio 48 9 none]
